# Gmail SMTP Credentials for Nodemailer Serverless Function
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google Account: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate an App Password under "App passwords": https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Enter the 16-character generated password below without spaces.

GMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password
BOOKING_TO=planwithmaham@gmail.com

# Base website URL (used for Terms & Conditions link in confirmation emails)
SITE_URL=https://thepolaroidstation.vercel.app
